            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From you, Nineveh, there came someone full of wicked schemes, who plotted against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to his people Israel: “Even though the Assyrians are strong and numerous, they will be destroyed and disappear. My people, I made you suffer, but I will not do it again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will now end Assyria's power over you and break the chains that bind you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
